{
  "id": "hydraulic_force_vs__pressure_and_cylinder_size",
  "title": "Hydraulic Force vs. Pressure and Cylinder Size",
  "description": "Calculator for hydraulic force produced by double acting hydraulic pistons based on pressure and cylinder dimensions. Supports both imperial (psi, inches) and metric (bar, mm) units.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Hydraulic Force Calculator\n\nCalculate the force produced by a double-acting hydraulic piston based on pressure and cylinder dimensions.\n\n**Formula for rod side force (F1):**\nF1 = P1 × (π × (d2² - d1²) / 4)\n\n**Formula for opposite rod side force (F2):**\nF2 = P2 × (π × d2² / 4)\n\nWhere:\n- F1, F2 = rod force (N or lb)\n- P1, P2 = pressure (bar or psi)\n- d1 = rod diameter (mm or in)\n- d2 = piston diameter (mm or in)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Metric Units (Rod Side - F1)"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "metric_piston_diameter_f1",
          "label": "Piston Diameter - d2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "metric_rod_diameter_f1",
          "label": "Rod Diameter - d1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "metric_pressure_f1",
          "label": "Cylinder Pressure - P1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "bar",
          "defaultValue": 10
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "metric_force_f1",
          "label": "Rod Force - F1",
          "formula": "inputs.metric_pressure_f1 * (3.14159265359 * (Math.pow(inputs.metric_piston_diameter_f1, 2) - Math.pow(inputs.metric_rod_diameter_f1, 2)) / 4) * 100",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Metric Units (Opposite Rod Side - F2)"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "metric_piston_diameter_f2",
          "label": "Piston Diameter - d2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "metric_pressure_f2",
          "label": "Cylinder Pressure - P2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "bar",
          "defaultValue": 10
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "metric_force_f2",
          "label": "Rod Force - F2",
          "formula": "inputs.metric_pressure_f2 * (3.14159265359 * Math.pow(inputs.metric_piston_diameter_f2, 2) / 4) * 100",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Imperial Units (Rod Side - F1)"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "imperial_piston_diameter_f1",
          "label": "Piston Diameter - d2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "in",
          "defaultValue": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "imperial_rod_diameter_f1",
          "label": "Rod Diameter - d1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "in",
          "defaultValue": 0.75
        },
        {
          "id": "imperial_pressure_f1",
          "label": "Cylinder Pressure - P1",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "psi",
          "defaultValue": 100
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "imperial_force_f1",
          "label": "Rod Force - F1",
          "formula": "inputs.imperial_pressure_f1 * (3.14159265359 * (Math.pow(inputs.imperial_piston_diameter_f1, 2) - Math.pow(inputs.imperial_rod_diameter_f1, 2)) / 4)",
          "unit": "lbf",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Imperial Units (Opposite Rod Side - F2)"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "imperial_piston_diameter_f2",
          "label": "Piston Diameter - d2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "in",
          "defaultValue": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "imperial_pressure_f2",
          "label": "Cylinder Pressure - P2",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "psi",
          "defaultValue": 100
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "imperial_force_f2",
          "label": "Rod Force - F2",
          "formula": "inputs.imperial_pressure_f2 * (3.14159265359 * Math.pow(inputs.imperial_piston_diameter_f2, 2) / 4)",
          "unit": "lbf",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}